{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Out-think the Enemy in Chaotic Capture-the-Flag Battles</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amass an army of slimes and compete to capture more flags than your opponent in hyper-fast, best-of-3 RTS battles!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Command your Slimes!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each slime can harvest &quot;Magic Fruits&quot; that can grow more slimes, attack enemy slimes, or capture flags.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more slimes allocated to a task, the faster it completes! Will you grow your army first for a surprise early-game attack, or sneak in an early flag-capture?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084910/extras/a14fd4281cca7b4e32eeb94efb0e0e46.poster.avif?t=1760666304\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084910/extras/a14fd4281cca7b4e32eeb94efb0e0e46.webm?t=1760666304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084910/extras/a14fd4281cca7b4e32eeb94efb0e0e46.mp4?t=1760666304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Watch Out for Guardians</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gargantuan Guardians linger throughout the map, eager to crush both you and your slimes with a single blow. Guide them away by getting inside their attack range (but not too close!), then strategically draw Guardians away so slimes can continue their duties. Try luring Guardians into enemy range to create near-impassable choke points!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Raise Walls to Redirect Enemy Movement</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Force the opponent to take the long route back to their base with well-placed walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084910/extras/c4735f9acb4d99bebd17e25d859d20bd.poster.avif?t=1760666304\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084910/extras/c4735f9acb4d99bebd17e25d859d20bd.webm?t=1760666304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084910/extras/c4735f9acb4d99bebd17e25d859d20bd.mp4?t=1760666304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Cast Spells to Turn the Tides of Battle</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search through the map for power-ups, like lightning strikes that instantly turn enemy armies into mush, ticking bombs, meteor showers, and more. Summon a trio of friendly Guardians to do your bidding, activate a speed boost, or go invisible for sneaky maneuvering across the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084910/extras/24dcaf8d22015f1d221ca8a612b0fb6c.poster.avif?t=1760666304\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084910/extras/24dcaf8d22015f1d221ca8a612b0fb6c.webm?t=1760666304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084910/extras/24dcaf8d22015f1d221ca8a612b0fb6c.mp4?t=1760666304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in Challenge Mode, play with friends with local split-screen multiplayer, or battle online against slime commanders across the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*controller is required for\u00a0local split-screen multiplayer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Apprentice Graduate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3084910/e93c81152837c5f285f3531f7c50ef99b967efe3.jpg"},{"name":"Challenge Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3084910/08f9f27d522e188f384fbeb909926a7c06320ed8.jpg"},{"name":"First Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3084910/52937ec00a4ea2389081429daa1a96c60c909e66.jpg"},{"name":"Triple Win","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3084910/4317b4ff826e8e9e957389de538d1f7b73998f85.jpg"},{"name":"Seasoned Fighter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3084910/0816cdf19ac1d93d044d94795ad0bb75617bc30c.jpg"},{"name":"Master Strategist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3084910/676828da03b30c155dfb261aea2372eb536974db.jpg"},{"name":"Big Family","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3084910/889582c17c33137148f76db0958b46c3a75d6a5b.jpg"},{"name":"Sneak Attack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3084910/36c21d2488ec2f6880503b247ee742a6fa470300.jpg"},{"name":"Architect","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3084910/af164a326786aa3d56b52f491296a68ab2d4d77b.jpg"},{"name":"Demolition Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3084910/2c1611f54e3c77fc3095983f2fba326d90228355.jpg"}],"total":17},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3084910?t=1760666304","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3084910?t=1760666304","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084910/be856